<div class="elvora-policy-page-wrapper">
  <!-- Subtle Header Banner -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-header">
    <div class="elvora-policy-badge">
      <span class="elvora-policy-dot"></span>
      <span>Official Store Policy • CS619 Compliant</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="elvora-policy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="elvora-policy-subtitle">
      How ELVORA Skincare collects, safeguards, and respects your personal and transaction data in accordance with modern e-commerce security standards.
    </p>
    <div class="elvora-policy-meta">
      <span>Last Updated: November 2026</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>256-Bit SSL Encrypted</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Zero Unauthorized Data Selling</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick Nav Tabs -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-tabs-nav">
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=shipping-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab">Shipping Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=privacy-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab is-active">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=return-and-refund-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab">Return & Refund Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=terms-and-conditions" class="elvora-policy-tab">Terms & Conditions</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=faq" class="elvora-policy-tab">FAQ</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact" class="elvora-policy-tab">Contact Us</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content Card -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-content-card">
    
    <!-- Highlights Grid -->
    <div class="elvora-policy-highlights-grid">
      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Banking-Grade Encryption</h4>
          <p>Every checkout and account session is protected via end-to-end 256-bit TLS/SSL encryption.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Never Sold or Rented</h4>
          <p>We strictly do not sell, rent, or trade your contact info with third-party telemarketers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>No Card Storage</h4>
          <p>Credit/Debit credentials bypass our servers directly to certified PCI-DSS payment gateways.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Full Account Control</h4>
          <p>Request data download, profile updates, or total account deletion anytime via support.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Article Sections -->
    <div class="elvora-policy-body">
      <h2>1. Introduction & Scope</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>ELVORA Skincare</strong> ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and discloses your personal information when you visit or make a purchase from our store at <strong>elvora-se1xnqm7.myshopify.com</strong>. By accessing our services, you acknowledge that you have read and accepted the practices described herein.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information directly from you when you interact with our website:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Order & Contact Information:</strong> Full name, shipping destination address, active Pakistani mobile number (vital for Cash on Delivery confirmation and courier delivery OTPs), and email address.</li>
        <li><strong>Customer Account Credentials:</strong> Encrypted password hash, saved delivery addresses, wishlist items, and order history.</li>
        <li><strong>Device & Browsing Metadata:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, time zone, referring URL, and session analytics collected via secure cookies.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Purpose of Data Processing</h2>
      <p>We process your personal information strictly for legitimate commercial and clinical fulfillment purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Dispatching and delivering your clinical skincare parcels through authorized logistics partners (TCS, Trax, Leopards, Call Courier).</li>
        <li>Sending real-time order confirmation, SMS tracking notifications, and delivery updates.</li>
        <li>Preventing fraudulent orders and duplicate Cash on Delivery bookings.</li>
        <li>Delivering personalized skincare recommendations and responding to customer support inquiries.</li>
        <li>Sending optional promotional emails or SMS newsletters (from which you can unsubscribe with a single click at any time).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Information Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
      <p>
        We only disclose minimum necessary personal details to trusted service partners under strict confidentiality agreements:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Logistics Couriers:</strong> Name, phone number, and address are provided solely to allow couriers to deliver your parcel and collect payment.</li>
        <li><strong>E-Commerce Infrastructure:</strong> Hosted securely on the Shopify enterprise cloud platform with round-the-clock SOC-2 compliance.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> We may disclose data if required by Pakistani judicial authorities or law enforcement subpoenas in the event of criminal fraud investigation.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Cookie Policy & Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        Our website uses essential functional cookies (to maintain your shopping bag items, login session, and currency selector) and performance cookies (to analyze page load speeds and optimize mobile responsiveness). You can disable non-essential cookies through your browser preferences.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under applicable data protection guidelines, you have the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request corrections to inaccurate contact info, or request permanent deletion of your customer profile.
      </p>

      <div class="elvora-policy-contact-box">
        <h4>Privacy Concerns or Data Requests?</h4>
        <p>Our Data Protection Officer can be reached directly via email or our contact desk.</p>
        <div class="elvora-policy-contact-actions">
          <a href="mailto:privacy@elvora.pk" class="elvora-policy-btn-email">
            <span>Email: privacy@elvora.pk</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/pages/contact" class="elvora-policy-btn-whatsapp">
            <span>Contact Support Desk</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  if (window.location.search.includes('view=privacy-policy') && !window.location.pathname.includes('privacy-policy')) {
    try { window.history.replaceState({}, '', '/pages/privacy-policy'); } catch(e){}
  }
</script>

